flowchart TD
    Route([Source-backed route variant]) --> Metadata{Prescriptive dimensions and source provenance valid?}
    Metadata -->|No| Invalid[Keep route metadata invalid and visible]
    Metadata -->|Yes| Select[Select existing target-tagged prescriptive block]
    Select --> Count{Exactly four target questions?}
    Count -->|No| Gap[Emit structural route gap]
    Count -->|Yes| Align[Align route facet directions to existing question effects]
    Align --> Mapped{At least one determinate route facet mapped?}
    Mapped -->|No| Gap
    Mapped -->|Yes| Trace[Emit source-linked non-scoring route trace]
    Trace --> Preserve[Preserve base family posture as contested or indeterminate]
    Gap --> Preserve
    Invalid --> Preserve
    Preserve --> Output([Coverage report and completion structural check])
